# Fly back above the takeoff point at the current altitude, then hold there.
#
# Accepted from HOLD or MISSION once mullet_core has latched a home at takeoff. The vehicle
# flies at return_home_speed_mps inside TRANSITION (active_action "return_home") and the goal
# succeeds on arrival, when the state becomes HOLD. Cancel, or the hold service, stops in
# place and holds. Land preempts it.
---
bool success
string message
---
float32 distance_m     # Horizontal distance to home, metres.
